l\'  // Load feedback form\n    ENDIF\nEND FUNCTION\n\nFUNCTION submit_feedback(feedback)\n    OPEN feedback.txt to append\n    WRITE feedback + "\\n"  // Save feedback to file\n    END OPEN\nEND FUNCTION\n```|Case|:**user_registration**\n```pseudocode\nFUNCTION register():\n    IF request.method IS \'POST\':\n        Retrieve username and password from request.form\n        \n        IF user_manager.register(username, password):\n            Redirect to login route\n        ELSE:\n            RENDER register.html with error message\n    ENDIF\n    RENDER register.html\nEND FUNCTION\n\n<FORM method="POST">\n    <INPUT type="text" name="username" placeholder="Username" required>\n    <INPUT type="password" name="password" placeholder="Password" required>\n    <BUTTON type="submit">Register</BUTTON>\n</FORM>\n```', '|Case|:**submit_feedback**\n```pseudocode\nFUNCTION feedback():\n    Assign user to session.get(\'username\', \'Guest\')\n    Retrieve feedback_text from request.form\n    \n    Call feedback_manager.submit_feedback(user, feedback_text)\n    Redirect to tips route\nEND FUNCTION\n\n<FORM method="POST" action="/feedback">\n    <TEXTAREA name="feedback" placeholder="Leave your feedback here..."></TEXTAREA>\n    <BUTTON type="submit">Submit Feedback</BUTTON>\n</FORM>\n```|Case|:**view_current_daily_health_tip**\n```pseudocode\nFUNCTION tips():\n    Assign current_tip to tip_manager.get_current_tip()\n    RENDER tips.html with current_tip\nEND FUNCTION\n\n<HTML>\n    <H1>Today\'s Health Tip</H1>\n    <P>{{ tip }}</P>\n</HTML>\n```']
